WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.951
"Let's make a snowman!" Emmy said.

2
00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:27.060
She made a big snowball.

3
00:00:27.061 --> 00:00:33.558
Harry put another snowball on top.

4
00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:38.890
Oliver tried to make the snowman's head.

5
00:00:38.891 --> 00:00:47.879
But he was too small.

6
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:53.285
Harry made eyes for the snowman.

7
00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:58.982
Emmy made a nose for the snowman.

8
00:00:58.983 --> 00:01:03.518
Oliver tried to make a mouth.

9
00:01:03.519 --> 00:01:10.285
But he was too small.

10
00:01:10.286 --> 00:01:14.741
Oliver looked sad.

11
00:01:14.742 --> 00:01:18.408
"You can find a hat," Harry said.

12
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:20.921
Emmy nodded.

13
00:01:20.922 --> 00:01:26.692
"Find a silly hat for the snowman!"

14
00:01:26.693 --> 00:01:31.696
Oliver got a soup pot.

15
00:01:31.697 --> 00:01:37.563
"This could be a silly hat," he said.

16
00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:42.934
Harry put it on the snowman.

17
00:01:42.935 --> 00:01:49.672
"Nope," Harry said.

18
00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:52.968
Oliver got a box.

19
00:01:52.969 --> 00:01:57.993
"This could be a silly hat!" he said.

20
00:01:57.994 --> 00:02:03.799
Emmy put it on the snowman.

21
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:12.135
"It's not right either," she said.

22
00:02:12.136 --> 00:02:15.931
Oliver got a scarf.

23
00:02:15.932 --> 00:02:20.005
"What about this?" he asked.

24
00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:28.229
Harry put the scarf on the snowman's head.

25
00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:33.268
Emmy shook her head again.

26
00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:38.956
"I know!" Oliver cried.

27
00:02:38.957 --> 00:02:43.425
He took the soup pot, and the box, and the scarf.

28
00:02:43.426 --> 00:02:45.683
He got some tape.

29
00:02:45.684 --> 00:02:49.372
He made a new hat.

30
00:02:49.373 --> 00:02:54.394
Harry put the hat on the snowman.

31
00:02:54.395 --> 00:03:00.822
Everyone laughed.

32
00:03:00.823 --> 00:03:06.174
"Now the snowman looks very silly!" Emmy said.

33
00:03:06.175 --> 00:03:09.387
Oliver grinned.

34
00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:12.435
"I'm small," he said.

35
00:03:12.436 --> 00:03:20.648
"But I have big ideas!"
